flowchart LR
  accTitle: Architecture
  accDescr: GitHub Actions deploys to Vercel, which serves the app and its AI functions. In the browser, the app saves to localStorage, links to OpenStreetMap and Google Maps, and calls the AI functions. The AI functions call Claude and Sarvam, and keep their keys on the server.
  subgraph Hosting
    actions[GitHub Actions] --> vercel[Vercel]
    vercel --> fn["AI functions<br/>api/ and server/"]
  end
  subgraph Browser
    app[Navexa app] --> store[(localStorage)]
  end
  subgraph Maps
    osm[OpenStreetMap]
    gmaps[Google Maps]
  end
  subgraph AI["AI services"]
    claude[Claude]
    sarvam[Sarvam]
  end
  vercel -->|serves| app
  app -->|asks| fn
  app --> osm
  app --> gmaps
  fn --> claude
  fn --> sarvam
